  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.Navamma vs State Of Ap on 24 September, 2019 Author: U. Durga Prasad Rao Bench: U. Durga Prasad Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice U. Durga Prasad Rao Criminal Petition No.4975 Of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners/A1 and A2 seek to quash the proceedings against them in C.C.No.297 of 2018 on the file of Additional Junior Civil Judge, Chilakaluripet, Guntur District, which was taken cognizance for the offences under Sections 188, 272, 273, 420 and 120-B of IPC and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act (for short, 'FSS Act'). 2. The allegations against the petitioners briefly are that on 25.03.2018 at 05.00 p.m., when the complainant along with his staff rushed to the petitioners baddi bunks in KB Road, by the side of Viswanadh Cinema Hall, Main Gate, found the banned tobacco products in their possession and hence, seized the same and registered a case in Crime No.274 of 2018 of Chilakaluripet Urban Police Station, for the offences stated supra.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for petitioners while denying the FIR allegations would submit that even if the prosecution case is accepted to be true, tobacco products would not fall within the definition of Section 3(j) of FSS Act and therefore, the Police are not authorized to register the crime, investigate and file charge sheet and therefore, registration of the FIR is contrary to the provisions of FSS Act. He relied upon the order of this Court in Crl.P.Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, dated 27.08.2018.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned counsel for petitioners while denying the FIR allegations would submit that even if the prosecution case is accepted to be true, tobacco products would not fall within the definition of Section 3(j) of FSS Act and therefore, the Police are not authorized to register the crime, investigate and file charge sheet and therefore, registration of the FIR is contrary to the provisions of FSS Act. He relied upon the order of this Court in Crl.P.Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, dated 27.08.2018.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
